  "content": "<p>是否曾梦想拥有动漫角色般的力量与能力？现在终于可以实现啦！</p><p>这款模组让你获得《一拳超人》中埼玉的无敌力量。</p><pre><span>只需合成\"埼玉之拳\"即可获得他的超凡能力。<br><br><em><strong>兼容模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI物品管理器<br><br></a></strong></em></span></pre><pre>欢迎协助翻译：<a href=\"https://github.com/BlackWolf00/One-Punch-Man-Public\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/BlackWolf00/One-Punch-Man-Public</a><span><em><strong><br></strong></em><br>特别感谢<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/escanorblock/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">EscanorBlock</a>的模组评测：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fZmZgSuFYMQ0\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/ZmZgSuFYMQ0</a><br><br><em><strong>埼玉之拳<br></strong></em><br></span></pre><pre><span>右键激活17种无敌特效（字面意义上的无敌！！），左键秒杀所有敌人——就像埼玉老师那样。<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zjCFtou.png\" alt=\"合成表\" width=\"408\" height=\"200\"><br><br><em><strong>能力展示<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fYuTChi.png\" alt=\"能力\" width=\"359\" height=\"200\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">推荐搭配模组：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/remove-potions-icons\" rel=\"nofollow\">移除药水图标</a>：</span></strong></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> 清除屏幕上烦人的药水效果图标<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-diamond\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易钻石</a>： </em></strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">若合成成本过高可降低难度<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-emerald\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易绿宝石</a>： <span style=\"font-size:12px\">若合成成本过高可降低难度<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblackwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/112d23b8-9986-4823-80de-d312484cf8c8.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></a></span></span></span></span></span><br><br></span></span></pre><p>BisectHosting提供全球十余个节点的快速、稳定游戏服务器